cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Marktstammdatenplotter
message: >-
  If you use this code or the rendered figures in your work,
  please cite both the software (this entry) and the upstream
  Marktstammdatenregister dataset (see references below).
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Paul
    family-names: Emmerich
    affiliation: original upstream author
  - given-names: Mayk
    family-names: Thewessen
    affiliation: Birdview Energy
    email: m.thewessen@birdviewenergy.ai
abstract: >-
  Python toolkit that scrapes the German Marktstammdatenregister
  (MaStR) public registry of electricity-generating units, joins
  records to OSM-derived county polygons, and renders time-lapse
  choropleth maps of installed wind and solar capacity. Ships
  with interactive marimo notebooks (PV + Wind explorers), a
  Read-the-Docs-styled GitHub Pages site, animated GIFs, and a
  weekly CI refresh.
keywords:
  - germany
  - renewable-energy
  - wind-power
  - photovoltaic
  - geospatial
  - marktstammdatenregister
  - choropleth
  - marimo
license: research-quality
repository-code: "https://github.com/MaykThewessen/marktstammdatenplotter"
url: "https://maykthewessen.github.io/marktstammdatenplotter/"
references:
  - type: data
    title: Marktstammdatenregister
    authors:
      - name: Bundesnetzagentur für Elektrizität, Gas, Telekommunikation, Post und Eisenbahnen
    url: "https://www.marktstammdatenregister.de/"
    notes: >-
      Public registry of electricity-generating units in Germany.
      Data © Bundesnetzagentur.
  - type: data
    title: OpenStreetMap administrative boundaries
    authors:
      - name: OpenStreetMap contributors
    url: "https://www.openstreetmap.org/"
    license: ODbL-1.0
